<main class="mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100vh-6rem)] w-full max-w-6xl items-center px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
  <section class="grid w-full gap-8 rounded-[2.25rem] border border-[#A3B18A]/35 bg-white/85 p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-[#344E41]/10 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:p-10">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.9rem] bg-[#344E41] p-8 text-white">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(212,163,115,0.24),_transparent_36%)]"></div>
      <div class="absolute -right-10 top-10 h-36 w-36 rounded-full border border-white/10"></div>
      <div class="absolute -left-8 bottom-8 h-24 w-24 rounded-full border border-[#A3B18A]/20"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-[#A3B18A]">Prayer Streak</p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur">
          <svg class="h-10 w-10 text-[#D4A373]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 9.75l4.5 4.5m0-4.5l-4.5 4.5M21 12A9 9 0 113 12a9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-7 text-white/72">
          Halaman ini tidak tersedia, tapi semua progress ibadahmu tetap aman. Gunakan navigasi utama atau kembali ke halaman sebelumnya.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
      <span class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-full border border-[#588157]/20 bg-[#588157]/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#588157]">
        Error <%= errorCode %>
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-[#344E41] sm:text-5xl"><%= heading %></h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-[#344E41]/72"><%= description %></p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="<%= primaryAction.href %>" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#588157] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#588157]/20 transition hover:bg-[#4B6F4E]">
          <%= primaryAction.label %>
        </a>
        <button type="button" onclick="window.history.back()" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-[#A3B18A]/35 bg-[#F6F1E9] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-[#344E41] transition hover:bg-[#A3B18A]/18">
          Kembali
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#A3B18A]/25 bg-[#F6F1E9]/70 p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#588157]">Cek URL</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#344E41]/70">Pastikan link yang dibuka tidak salah ketik atau terpotong.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[#A3B18A]/25 bg-[#F6F1E9]/70 p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#588157]">Pakai Menu</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#344E41]/70">Buka lagi dari dashboard, Al-Qur'an, Hadis, atau Doa lewat navigasi utama.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
